WEBVTT

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.190
Long, long ago,

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.820
a beautiful kingdom floated high in the sky.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.440
On its throne sat a round, noble, white cat,

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.900
and a muddy, black cat fell in love with her.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.900
That was how it all began.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.980
That way, Your Highness.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.230
All right.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.650
You're...?!

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.900
That wasn't very nice.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.780
What'd you have to chop me up for?

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:22.030
I considered you an ally, you know.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.900
I thought it was too easy!

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:26.610
Damn right it was.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.400
I'm a potential successor to the throne, too.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:36.360
And I've got a lot more monster in me than you.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.690
See?

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.440
What were you thinking?

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.690
Huh?

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.690
Why did you attack the Queen of Light?!

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:54.860
It was His Majesty's wish

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.360
and the will of the Kingdom of Black.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.320
What are you babbling about?

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.440
I should be asking you why you stopped me.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.940
Or so I'd like to say,

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:08.440
but that actually worked out for the best.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.860
What?

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.940
The Queen of Light

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.900
is really just a little girl.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:18.900
A shock like that'll
fill her with doubt before long.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.730
Then, she'll be no threat.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:25.030
When two people with equal power go at it,

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:28.070
the one who doesn't give in wins.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.690
So, that was part of the king's strategy, too.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:38.030
Everybody takes His Majesty too lightly.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:43.480
The instinct to live bigger is what gave rise
to intelligence in the first place.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.570
All of you who think he's stupid
are the real idiots.

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.230
I see.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:51.030
That's why he wants to purge me here!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:01.150
What idiot still wouldn't get it at this point?

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.070
Don't try to act smart.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:10.650
Although... I guess that braindead
dark knight doesn't know this either.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:12.440
Even Vallus?!

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.110
I know how His Majesty thinks.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.400
I'm swimming in darkness, after all.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:22.150
It might even be His Majesty
who gave birth to me.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.230
Well, none of that matters.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:31.070
He got you and Groza out of the way

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.980
because there was a chance
you'd get into bed with White.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.610
Get into...?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.190
It's a figure of speech.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.230
Don't take it literally, stupid.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:42.610
It just means you'd be hard to manage.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.150
But don't get the wrong idea.

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:49.650
If the King of Darkness got serious,
you'd be nothing to him.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:55.030
It just means His Majesty's wise enough
to still not let his guard down!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.610
Satisfied now?!

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.570
Let's do this!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.940
I won't let you have it all your way.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.860
Your way of doing things is wrong!

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.690
Is that all you've got?!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.070
You must really not take me seriously!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.280
So, you really were holding back.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.230
Man,

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.690
you're such a pain in the ass!

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.900
What?!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.530
Did you think that'd be enough to finish me off,

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:05.070
Your Highness?!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.400
Die!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:52.440
Too bad!

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:05.860
D-Damn you!

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.900
Don't blame me.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.440
You left me no choice.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:29.900
As if you could turn the tables that easily.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.610
What?

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.730
Why send just me?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:36.780
To buy time, obviously.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:40.530
Most of our forces are in the sky.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.570
The King of Darkness, too, of course.

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:46.860
How long will the Kingdom of White last
with its light wavering?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.690
No, they'd never be able to hold out.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.480
Once His Majesty absorbs the Progenitor Rune,

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.780
darkness will cover all space,

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:00.400
and the balance will collapse.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.150
Once that happens, this world's done for.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.820
No one'll survive,

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:08.860
not from either kingdom.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:10.400
What?!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:16.480
Isn't his goal to conquer the sky and
envelope everything in peaceful darkness?!

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:20.280
If you never questioned
how much sense that really makes,

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:23.480
that makes you a real dimwit.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.070
Not just their kingdom, but ours, too!

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.900
He wants to destroy everything!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:33.610
Then what does that make
the people who believed in him?!

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.280
He may be king,

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:38.280
but that doesn't give him that kind of right!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.860
Well then, I'll go a step ahead of you...

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:44.610
...into peaceful darkness.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:56.190
So, this is why he kept me

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.030
away from the light.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.070
The sky is high,

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.360
and the Kingdom of White is far away.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.070
Your Highness!

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.400
Solitaire Orage!

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.030
Groza!

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:40.820
Leave this to me!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.940
Hurry!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.690
Thank you.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:03.690
Révolte Éclair!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:08.530
Damn you, King of Darkness!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:11.650
Up in the sky, out of reach,

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:14.070
are you planning to decide

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.650
everyone's futures on your own?!

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.860
Damn it!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.980
I can't reach him from down here
in the bowels of the earth.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.690
I won't make it!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.530
Power?!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.730
From where?

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.610
Who's there?

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:03.070
With this power...!

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.530
Let me be in time!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.940
Iris!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:17.980
"No. 12 The Progenitor Rune"
"The Source of the Kingdom of White's power.
Mages borrow its power through their tiaras.
The one who can draw out the most of the
Progenitor Rune's power is the Queen of Light."

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.610
How unsightly.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.400
How long will you struggle?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:23.150
Accept your fated--

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.400
Do you ever shut up?!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.980
Interesting!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.400
Lady Sheama?!

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.980
It appears I've let one of my bad habits show:

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.940
"playfulness."

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:05.400
White Priestess, Queen of Light,

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:07.280
Iris...

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.570
Why?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.110
Why not me?

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.530
Why does she have...

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.440
...everything I want?!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:26.400
White Priestess!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.730
Are you all right, Lady Sheama?!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:44.150
Y-Yes. Was I...?

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.150
Swallowed by darkness.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.690
I see.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.440
The King of Darkness isn't so tough!

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:59.650
He can't even corrupt a single mage!

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:02.110
That's our Lady Sheama!

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.530
And Her Majesty?

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.280
Safe, I think.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.440
All right.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:10.360
We'll continue mopping up
the monsters in the city!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.440
We're going to keep the people safe!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.610
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.650
O Progenitor Rune...

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:27.730
I was not able to protect

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.860
the Kingdom of White.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:32.820
Or the balance of light and dark.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.940
I guess that makes me a liar.

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.110
I said I'd wait for you

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:43.320
and make a peaceful world.

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.400
What would it have been like?

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.650
Now that everything I have has failed,

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:55.940
this is the only way I have left

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.940
to stop the darkness.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:06.230
Get out of my way!

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.650
Faster!

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:14.400
Even faster!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:19.320
No... This is wrong!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:22.190
That's right! This is wrong!

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.360
I don't know what it is,

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:29.530
but I have an intense feeling
that it's "twisted."

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:32.610
Where did things go wrong?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:37.980
Or, if what's right was never
set-in-stone in the first place,

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.230
then what are this world's laws for?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:45.650
If you wish, the way of the world...!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.230
I don't know yet.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.400
Still!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:52.400
It isn't there to feel sorrow.

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:55.570
You aren't here to miss each other!

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:59.110
It's because I don't know

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.730
that I have to ask!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.610
I must do something.

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:06.150
Please don't get in my way!

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.690
I'm sorry.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.400
What is evil?

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.070
Do I not know that because

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:19.650
something else is mixed with
the things I should believe in?

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:22.860
Damn!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.900
Faster!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.820
The age of White is now at an end.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.360
If I'm not with you...

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.150
Even so, the world will maintain balance.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.820
...here and now, what was our promise for?!

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.070
Because I should not exist,

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.360
I will commit a sin.

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.570
I will...

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:45.900
So please, Progenitor Rune!

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.780
...protect Iris!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.400
Unleash all that you conceal...

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.400
...and seal away...

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.150
...darkness...

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.900
...and Black!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.940
What are these tremors?!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.440
Damn... you!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.400
So, he ran away.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:25.360
Is Her Majesty safe?

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:27.440
Where is she now?

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.280
What?!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:33.030
The Progenitor Rune's radiance?!

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:34.320
It's too strong!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.690
Don't tell me...

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.400
Self-destruction?!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.610
The people of White are still--

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:42.780
Sheama!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.530
What are you doing here?!

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.320
This is hopeless!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.530
Theo?

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.650
Damn it.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.780
But I won't give up!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:56.900
They won't catch me,
even if I'm the last one left.

00:16:56.900 --> 00:17:00.230
I'll keep running forever!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:14.610
Why?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.610
I won...

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.280
...and yet...

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:22.230
Why won't you wait for me?!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.980
Why?!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.610
What?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.980
Iris!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.650
Oh no...

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.320
I'm... sorry.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:05.480
Goodbye, my promised one.

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:10.440
Iris!

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.650
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:31.030
<i>The world is so beautiful again today,</i>

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:44.690
<i>and I want to show you the clear sky,</i>
<i>the color of the clouds</i>

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.230
<i>Say, do you remember the promise we made?</i>
Don't tell me...

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:52.190
<i>Say, do you remember the promise we made?</i>
<i></i>

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.860
<i>Say, do you remember the promise we made?</i>
The White Priestess...

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.940
<i>Say, do you remember the promise we made?</i>
<i></i>

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:04.440
<i>Please believe and find me</i>

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:10.360
<i>in the world of white and black</i>

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.030
<i>Feel it gently and don't turn away</i>
<i></i>
<i></i>

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:14.530
<i>Feel it gently and don't turn away</i>
Curse you.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:17.070
<i>Feel it gently and don't turn away</i>
Don't tell me you mean to strike me

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.150
<i>Feel it gently and don't turn away</i>
with both the Progenitor Rune
and the floating continent!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.940
<i>because I'll wish once more</i>
with both the Progenitor Rune
and the floating continent!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.530
<i>because I'll wish once more</i>

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.820
<i>because I'll wish once more</i>
What?!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:31.940
<i>Because there's darkness, there's also light</i>

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:36.070
<i>White is black, black is white</i>
D-Damn you!

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.900
<i>White is black, black is white</i>
Let's go down together.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:39.190
<i>White is black, black is white</i>
That... was her wish.

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.530
That... was her wish.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:48.940
Disappear!

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:54.440
Curse you!

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.530
Goodbye,

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:59.150
Iris.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:08.610
<i>When can I meet you?</i>

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:19.280
<i>If only I could at least hear</i>
<i>your voice in my dreams</i>

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:32.690
<i>No matter how many times</i>
<i>the seasons change, you, my beloved,</i>

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:45.110
<i>the warmth in your eyes, still burns in my heart</i>

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:52.570
<i>So realize and don't be afraid,</i>

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:58.610
<i>world of white and black</i>

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:06.190
<i>Connect someday, and don't let go</i>

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:12.480
<i>Differences aren't mistakes</i>

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:27.730
<i>Let's fall asleep again tonight</i>
<i>in the gentle embrace of darkness</i>

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:36.530
<i>Please believe and find me</i>

00:22:36.530 --> 00:22:42.440
<i>in the world of white and black</i>

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:50.150
<i>Feel it gently and don't turn away</i>

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:57.280
<i>because I'll wish once more</i>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:23:04.110
<i>Because there's darkness, there's also light</i>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:09.110
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"
<i>White is black, black is white</i>

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:14.080
"The Sin of the Beginning"
<i>White is black, black is white</i>

00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:24.650
Why didn't you wait for me?

00:23:24.650 --> 00:23:26.980
Why,

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:28.860
Iris?
